<title>AUSTRALIA: Cricket-Australian XI thrash West Indies by 10 wickets.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Australian XI thrash West Indies by 10 wickets.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Australian XI beat West Indies by 10 wickets on the fourth and final day of their tour match at Bellerive Oval on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australian XI 544 for four declared (Matthew Hayden 224, Matthew Elliot 158) and 28 for no wicket; West Indies 317 (Courtney Browne 93 not out) and 251 (Shivnarine Chanderpaul 77, Brian Lara 63, Greg Blewett five for 29).</p>
<p>--Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
